{"reviews":[{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-0","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful. Great deal.","x":"Love it. Great quality. Cute colors. Large. Great for the price. The tooth brush caddy and 3 piece bathroom photos are also from amazon. Love it.","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-1","r":5.0,"t":"Cute and holds A LOT","x":"This was exactly what my unicorn obsessed daughter needed to hold her bows and headbands. As you can tell, it holds A LOT!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-2","r":5.0,"t":"My girls LOVED","x":"This is super cute! I got this for my girls \u201cpigtail\u201d bows, and braided the side for their headbands. Would definitely buy again, and recommend to any mommy with unicorn loving girls!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-3","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"My daughter is obsessed with hair bows right now and has a huge collection so this is perfect! And it\u2019s super cute and well made. She currently has 19 eight inch bows hanging on it! The color it much better in person than in my picture.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-4","r":5.0,"t":"A well designed hair clip holder for a great price!","x":"The product arrived super fast and it was very beautiful and looked just as good as the photos! It\u2019s the perfect size for displaying over 100 hair clips and I love that you can have the ability to tie some of the ends to hold hair elastics in place. My daughter loves looking at and choosing the hair ties from the unicorn hair clip holder and it looks great in her room!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-5","r":5.0,"t":"Cutest bow holder ever!","x":"Bought this for my granddaughter when I bought her all the multicolored bows here. This works so well for those and also holds her headbands!! It holds a lot so there's no need to worry about not having enough space on it. My granddaughter has at least 75 bows. LoL","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-6","r":5.0,"t":"Good","x":"This is such a cute way to hang your hair accessories! Very girly and giftable. The middle pattern part is very durable and tight. The strings are soft and easy to tie. This product was made very well and priced good.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-7","r":5.0,"t":"Cute and Functional","x":"This unicorn bow holder is so cute I almost want to use it for decoration and not for its intended purpose. Other than been adorable it holds tons of hair clips on the strands and on the top portion as well.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-8","r":5.0,"t":"The best gift at the party","x":"Bought this as a gift for a 5 year old girl who loves JoJo. It was her favorite gift and her mom appreciated getting something useful. Very pretty and good quality. Seems like it will hold up well.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-9","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful and works great","x":"Beautiful bow and headband holder. Love it for my daughter's room. Great quality for the price. Pretty and cute. I'm glad I bought it. Can't wait to purchase more bows and headbands to hang them.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-10","r":5.0,"t":"Great accessory holder","x":"This accessory holder has been a great addition to our 3 year old\u2019s bedroom. She now wants to put her hair clips away, rather than leave them scattered all round her room. Just what we needed!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-11","r":5.0,"t":"My 4 year old lived it and it was just as described and priced right!","x":"Cute and works great! My 4-year-old daughter loves it and it keeps everything in one place except for her ponytail holders! It Was priced right, arrived fast and was just as described!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-12","r":5.0,"t":"A must for a girl who loves bows","x":"I\u2019m so glad I came across this hair clip holder. It definitely hold a bunch of clips/ headbands and looks extremely stylish. I love how it keeps my daughters clips so organized!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-13","r":5.0,"t":"love this, buy it!!!!","x":"I love love love this definitely what I needed for my baby girl who has over 80 bows, clips and headbands. Thank you sooo cute definitely see this following her for a while.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-14","r":5.0,"t":"Very good","x":"This bow holder is SO cute on my daughters wall and holds tons of bows. I\u2019m so glad I bought this, it\u2019s going to be cute in her room for many years. Seems like good quality","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-15","r":5.0,"t":"My daughter loves it.","x":"Clip hair bows or braid stains to stick head bands through. Holds many but gets crowded quickly. The unique design and ability to hold hair bows made my daughter love it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-16","r":4.0,"t":"Crooked/ bent horn","x":"It was very soft! My sister loved it! I was a bit sad that the horn was crooked and an ear was down. We can adjust that though! Happy with this purchase!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-17","r":5.0,"t":"Pretty hair clip Holder","x":"This was a great space saver that is functional AND attractive. My 7 year old daughter loves unicorns and she LOVES this clip holder.  Would recommend.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-18","r":5.0,"t":"Cute hair-bow holder or wall decor","x":"Very cute bow and headband holder. Looks great as decor in my daughters room, and is also functional. Well made, cute colors, happy with our purchase.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-19","r":5.0,"t":"Adorable and Affordable","x":"Perfect to keep up with my baby girls bows. I didn\u2019t even know I needed this until I saw it and purchased it. Super cute and a great price!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-20","r":5.0,"t":"Cute!","x":"My little girls bows were out of control  she leaves them everywhere! But after this organazer she makes it clean cute and sturdy","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-21","r":5.0,"t":"I BOUGHT TWO!","x":"VERY HAPPY WITH M PURCHASE, I BOUGHT 2, ONE FOR EACH OF MY DAUGHTERS AND THEY ARE SUCH A SPACE SAVER, PLUS THEY ARE SUPER CUTE!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality","x":"Love this! Great quality, fast shipping. Looks adorable on my daughters wall. Really easy to clip bows, hairties and headbands.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-23","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful bow holder","x":"My daughter loved it. Very convenient for her bows. I recommended for every parent that have a daughter plus is very stylish.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07M6MXTH2-24","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect","x":"This is so beautiful. I love it. Keeps all my bows together and away from my 1 year old who made a mess of her bows before.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers consistently describe the holder as very cute and adorable.","cites":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,10,12,14,15]},{"text":"It holds a large number of bows, clips, and headbands, with many noting it holds dozens to over 100 items.","cites":[2,4,5,6,8,13,14,15]},{"text":"Buyers consider it good quality and well made.","cites":[1,4,7,9,10,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers feel it is a great value for the price.","cites":[1,5,7,10,12]},{"text":"It is frequently praised as a gift, especially for young girls, and helps keep hair accessories organized.","cites":[3,9,11,12,13]}]},"qa":[]}